#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD1328 expect=noViolation domain=RELSUB
#note "Isolates the LEADING not empty(RSUBJID) guard. Row 1: a pool-to-subject row - RSUBJID populated, USUBJID empty, not equal, silent. Row 2: BOTH USUBJID and RSUBJID empty - without the leading guard, comparing two empty cells would compare equal and fire; the guard short-circuits first. Row 2 is DELIBERATELY MALFORMED (RSUBJID is Required in RELSUB) and exists to prove the guard, not to model a real submission."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset RELSUB label="Related Subjects"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col POOLID  type=Char label="Pool Identifier"
col RSUBJID type=Char label="Related Subject or Pool Identifier"
col SREL    type=Char label="Subject Relationship"
---
CDISCPILOT01 |  | POOL01 | 01-701-1015 | LITTERMATE
CDISCPILOT01 |  | POOL02 |             | LITTERMATE
